# LanCartographer .gitignore
#
# Tracked on purpose (generated, but source for reproducible builds):
#   - cmd/lancartographer/resource.syso: Windows version resource from
#     goversioninfo (versioninfo.json + app.manifest + app.ico). A fresh clone
#     must build without running `go generate`.
#   - internal/oui/oui_data.go: embedded OUI database generated from
#     internal/oui/data.csv. Without it, vendor lookup would need a network
#     fetch, which this project forbids.
#   - go.sum: module checksums. Never ignore it.
# The re-includes at the bottom keep these tracked even if a broader rule is
# added later. Patterns are deliberately narrow: a broad word glob here (for
# example *credentials*) would silently hide a future Go file. Secret
# detection is gitleaks' job, not this file's.

# --- Go build and test output ----------------------------------------------
dist/
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
*.coverprofile
coverage.out
coverage.html
profile.cov
*.prof
*.pprof
*.trace
go.work
go.work.sum
/vendor/
# Do NOT ignore testdata/fuzz/: `go test -fuzz` writes failing inputs there,
# and they are committed as regression cases. The fuzz cache lives in GOCACHE.

# --- Local runtime data: may contain real LAN inventory, never commit ------
# Default saved-session name from internal/gui/sessions.go.
session-*.json
# Use these for disposable APPDATA dirs and local CLI --json/CSV output.
/.scratch/
/.smoke/
.tmp-*
*.log

# --- Agent and tool local state ---------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
.superpowers/

# --- Python (build/macos-smoke.py is stdlib-only) ---------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Secrets and key material -----------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
.envrc
!.env.example
!.env.template
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
.aws/
.gnupg/
.ssh/

# --- Editors and OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Re-includes: keep last ---------------------------------------------------
!cmd/lancartographer/resource.syso
!internal/oui/oui_data.go
!go.sum
